; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">구미시에서는 대학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">생의 참신한 아이디어로부터 시정 현안에 대한 해결방안과 신성장 동력 미래시책을 발굴하고</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">학업에 대한 연구와 시정을 접목하여 시정 참여 기회를 제공하고자 다음과 같이 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">대학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">생 시정 연구논문 공모전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">을 개최하오니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">공모전 개요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">주최</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">주관 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">구미시</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">응모기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014. 6. 23 ~ 8. 31 (70</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">일간</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">응모자격 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">주민등록 주소지 또는 등록기준지가 구미시인 대학생 또는 대학원생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">수료자 포함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">구미시 관내 대학교에 재학중인 대학생 또는 대학원생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">수료자 포함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang